steam/apps/3845520/extras/1ab53fdd86154a54c766e410610d3429.avif?t=1754576726\" width=616 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget checkpoints and auto-saves. In Timber Panic, your trusty wooden outhouse at the back of the yard is where progress gets written down. (We sneak in a few auto-saves too<i>, but shh...</i>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s humble, a little odd \u2014 but it belongs here. Every visit marks a new page in your cozy chopping adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845520/extras/9f79cce26d91cc37c89d2c0fed798527.poster.avif?t=1754576726\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845520/extras/9f79cce26d91cc37c89d2c0fed798527.webp?t=1754576726\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=300 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845520/extras/0e0731f4532b64a7fd7aab41e746de01.avif?t=1754576726\" width=616 height=163 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What\u2019s next?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here\u2019s a glimpse at the cozy updates we\u2019re planning for <i>Timber Panic</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features will be added gradually, following the order below:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game idea (\u2705)</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy game about cutting trees.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cut, upgrade, expand. Repeat.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core\u00a0(\u2705)</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chop trees and collect logs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock upgrades to boost progress.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Refining (\ud83d\udd1c)</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn logs into planks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extend game\u2019s economy.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hiring (\ud83d\udd1c)</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire workers to automate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let others do the hard work =)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expanding (\ud83d\udd1c)</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new forest zones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover more tree types and expand your production.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Craft &amp; Deliver (\ud83d\udd1c)</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build furniture from refined wood.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fulfill customer orders through deliveries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adding minigames\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845520/extras/8766f27741adb48f4554b30277950b68.avif?t=1754576726\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf32\u00a0One click now, endless calm later. </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist <i>Timber Panic</i></strong> and let the forest wait for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
